  "notes": "The Gathering is never drawn. 46 and 49:1-11 concern the Prophet ﷺ: no motif there. 47:4-12 is not glossed: the tafsirs differ on when the judgement between a nation and its messenger falls (Al-Muyassar: the Hereafter; As-Sa'di: this world). Their question (48) is framed. An hourglass for «كأن لم يلبثوا إلا ساعة» and for «لكل أمة أجل». 49:1-11 is one chip, so «إلا ما شاء الله» stays with «لا أملك»; its gloss is As-Sa'di's «وأما حسابهم… فمن الله تعالى»."
